    "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-29T14:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (rp_batch_15): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nFor RP batch 15 weekly QA audit exports prepared from today, the manifest must be JSON rather than a prose list. Use the fields batch_id, audit_date, and task_ids, and name the file rp15_audit_YYYY-MM-DD.json. This is an administrative handoff format for QA files. It does not change how we compare the model responses in a task or settle any accuracy-versus-format tradeoff in those responses."
