    "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-16T14:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (rp_batch_14): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nPreference batch 14 calibration: choose a tie when neither answer offers a meaningful quality advantage. If choosing A or B, identify the user-facing benefit rather than saying only that it sounds nicer. Keep material factual or instruction-following defects separate. Bring both rationales for disputed pairs to the eight-pair calibration review. This message clarifies the existing criterion; it does not create a new numerical threshold."
